---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="FAQ"
  description="Frequently asked questions for Viral Templates keyword sites."
  canonicalPath="/faq/"
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="page-head wrap"><h1>FAQ</h1><p>Shared answers across keyword sites.</p></div>
  <section class="section wrap prose">
    <h2>What is “one keyword per subdomain”?</h2>
    <p>Each viral template is its own site (<code>{`{slug}.apex`}</code>). This apex only lists them. Preview without DNS via <code>{`/t/{slug}/`}</code>.</p>
    <h2>Is generate real?</h2>
    <p>Not yet. Generate and Pay are explicit stubs — no fake success, no fal/Waffo calls until env is wired.</p>
    <h2>Adult consent?</h2>
    <p>Yes. No minors. Kiss Cam uses no real concert footage. Ceiling Fan: never strap a phone to a fan.</p>
    <h2>Photo retention?</h2>
    <p>About 30 days after upload/job — see Privacy.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
